	"Name": "Easter Bunnies for 1.6",
	"Author": "Tarniyar",
	"Description": "Updated to be compatible with 1.6.\u00A0 Now only requires Content Patcher and FTM (required for forage).\n<br />\n<br />This mod adds four adorable colors of Easter Bunnies that hop around and lay brightly-colored Easter eggs.\u00A0 They produce less often than normal rabbits, but the eggs are very valuable, and they have a higher chance of producing rabbits' feet.\u00A0 And you can also process the eggs to make valuable Easter Mayonnaise.\n<br />\n<br />You can find the eggs as forage in the Secret Woods in Spring, with a guaranteed chance from Spring 11-13.\u00A0 Also, Krobus will sell you one random egg a day in the Spring.\n<br />\n<br />The Easter Bunny sprites are based off the hopping rabbits sprites by Feathercatch:\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1013]https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1013\n<br />\n<br />[/url]",
